                <mxCell id="804" value="&lt;b&gt;4)&amp;nbsp; se hace un inner join entre T_UOM_01 (PUM) y UNITS_OF_MEASURE_PE_M (EA) donde PUM.MATNR = EA.MATNR&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;y PUM.MEINH=&#39;PUM&#39; y EA.MEINH=&#39;EA&#39; y ordenamos por MATNR, para crear la tabla UOM_EA_PUM_KG renombramos unas columnas: PUM.MEINH as MEINH_PUM, PUM.UMREZ as UNREZ_PUM, PUM.UMREN as UMREN_PUM, PUM.YYPAR as PPC, EA.MEINH as MEINH_EA, EA.UMREZ as UMREZ.EA, EA.UMREN as UMREN_EA&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;" vertex="1" parent="633">
